{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-253dd43d-694d-4817-9b73-97fb87a579c4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc42273050b1a277","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-8007-5ww_zm6p/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-8007-E003.md","content":"# UXD designs for Feature Store admin UI (wizard, list, detail)\n\n## Description\n\nDelivers the UX design assets — wireframes and interaction patterns — for the Feature Store admin UI in the RHOAI dashboard: the guided create wizard, the instance management list page, the read-only detail/inspect view, and the delete confirmation dialog. The strategy carries the `needs-uxd` label and lists UXD design as a dependency required before frontend implementation; the frontend epics build against these design assets.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Wireframes and interaction patterns for the guided create form wizard mapping the `FeatureStore` CRD spec (namespace, registry type, online/offline store backends, authorization mode, TLS, scaling, materialization schedule) to a PatternFly 6 form experience.\n- Wireframes and interaction patterns for the management list page (name, namespace, status, creation timestamp, inspect/delete row actions) and the read-only detail view.\n- Interaction pattern for the delete confirmation dialog.\n- State design for deployment progress / readiness presentation (deploying → ready) and for non-admin (viewer) presentation where write controls are hidden.\n- Design guidance for air-gapped suitability (no external assets or network-fetched content in the design).\n- Use the validated engineering prototype (odh-dashboard draft PR #7013) as the starting design reference to accelerate the design cycle, per the strategy's risk mitigation.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Wireframes covering the create wizard, list page, detail view, and delete confirmation dialog are delivered and reviewed.\n- Interaction patterns specify the viewer (non-admin) experience with write controls absent, consistent with the admin/viewer authorization model.\n- Designs use bundled PatternFly 6 components only — no external network-fetched assets.\n- Designs are validated against the prototype's screens and the RHOAI dashboard design conventions.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Enables HLR-1 (P0: guided create form wizard) — wizard design.\n- Enables HLR-2, HLR-3, HLR-4 (P0: list, inspect, delete) — management page designs.\n- Supports HLR-6 (P1: viewer browse without create/delete actions) — viewer state design.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":48592,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83035eeaf0612315","agent_id":"af9a83e3527bcd761","session_id":"5b25fd68-a792-4553-b4a0-957d31cb4ef6","uuid":"104c2bdf-a26a-4d91-b6df-d0bc8dadd4e1","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:28:33.845Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8007 into epics"}
