resentation (deploying → ready) and for non-admin (viewer) presentation where write controls are hidden.\n41\t- Design guidance for air-gapped suitability (no external assets or network-fetched content in the design).\n42\t- Use the validated engineering prototype (odh-dashboard draft PR #7013) as the starting design reference to accelerate the design cycle, per the strategy's risk mitigation.\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- Wireframes covering the create wizard, list page, detail view, and delete confirmation dialog are delivered and reviewed.\n47\t- Interaction patterns specify the viewer (non-admin) experience with write controls absent, consistent with the admin/viewer authorization model.\n48\t- Designs use bundled PatternFly 6 components only — no external network-fetched assets.\n49\t- Designs are validated against the prototype's screens and the RHOAI dashboard design conventions.\n50\t\n51\t## HLR Traceability\n52\t\n53\t- Enables HLR-1 (P0: guided create form wizard) — wizard design.\n54\t- Enables HLR-2, HLR-3, HLR-4 (P0: list, inspect, delete) — management page designs.\n55\t- Supports HLR-6 (P1: viewer browse without create/delete actions) — viewer state design.\n56\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b6e66effc20ce822","agent_id":"ab04e8cb75b4a6236","session_id":"5b25fd68-a792-4553-b4a0-957d31cb4ef6","uuid":"8c1ac38b-7e36-4231-9432-38cf21091a8c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:39:24.428Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b5b059394c315a97","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8007 decomposition"}
