 but cannot create or delete.\n44\t- Document disconnected/air-gapped deployment instructions, including OLM image mirroring via the operator's `RELATED_IMAGE_*` environment variables as it applies to the admin UI workflow.\n45\t- Document feature-flag gating in `OdhDashboardConfig` for administrators controlling rollout.\n46\t- Capture screenshots of the shipped UI (wizard, list, detail views) as part of the same change.\n47\t\n48\t## Acceptance Criteria\n49\t\n50\t- The admin-guide topic covers create, monitor, inspect, and delete workflows end to end, matching the shipped UI behavior.\n51\t- Disconnected/air-gapped deployment instructions are included and technically reviewed against the implementation.\n52\t- The content is technically reviewed by engineering against the implemented feature (screenshots, field names, and flows match the shipped UI).\n53\t- Editorial review through the Red Hat docs content process is complete.\n54\t\n55\t## HLR Traceability\n56\t\n57\t- Documents HLR-1 through HLR-5 (P0: create, list, inspect, delete, status tracking) — user-facing instructions for each flow.\n58\t- Documents HLR-6 (P1: viewer experience) and HLR-7 (P1: disconnected deployment instructions).\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6da3b0b539286d2","agent_id":"ac2adcea6f526cc79","session_id":"5b25fd68-a792-4553-b4a0-957d31cb4ef6","uuid":"065db5f6-a7a6-456e-b7cb-3db0b8e73a64","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:51:00.089Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3f8bdd58deeb5c9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Second revision of RHAISTRAT-8007"}
